# System-library leaks: none has a frame in Lattis code.
# Font lookup through the Qt platform theme.
leak:libfontconfig.so
leak:libpangoft2-1.0.so
leak:libpango-1.0.so
# One-time initialisers of the Vulkan drivers Qt probes and unloads. The drivers are unloaded before the
# report, so their frames show as <unknown module>; the only symbolised frames are libasan's realloc and
# libc's pthread_once, and a rule matches one frame, so this one is as narrow as the report allows.
# It also hides a leak made inside a pthread_once or std::call_once initialiser. Lattis uses neither
# (grep src/ and tests/); if that changes, drop this line and look at the report instead.
leak:__pthread_once_slow
